<title>UK: Omnicare receives possible bid approach.</title>
<headline>Omnicare receives possible bid approach.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Omnicare Plc said on Thursday it had received an approach that might lead to a bid for the company.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
